# Redirect map for the old DreamHost PHP site (see snapshot/), so every inbound
# link and search result lands somewhere real instead of a 404. See #25.
#
# Cloudflare's _redirects matching is case-sensitive; the old Apache setup
# effectively wasn't — seven project pages were committed twice, once per
# casing (see 560f920's diff), so both the linked casing and the plain-
# lowercase casing actually resolved on the live site. Both are covered below
# for those seven; the other eight project URLs already matched their old
# casing exactly, or (gameOverEverAfter) have no destination to send to.
#
# Top-level pages (/, /about, /contact, /resume, /projects) are identity
# matches already — same extensionless URLs, confirmed by crawl, no rule
# needed. /projects/firefall, /projects/kaneva, /projects/kinoclue, and
# /projects/prodigal are also identity matches: same single-word lowercase
# slug on both sites.

# --- Project pages: old mixed-case slug -> new hyphenated slug -------------
/projects/artOfRescue        /projects/art-of-rescue        301
/projects/artofrescue        /projects/art-of-rescue        301
/projects/corExMachina       /projects/cor-ex-machina       301
/projects/corexmachina       /projects/cor-ex-machina       301
/projects/critter            /projects/critter-3            301
/projects/deadBooty          /projects/dead-booty           301
/projects/deadbooty          /projects/dead-booty           301
/projects/itWillKillYou      /projects/it-will-kill-you     301
/projects/itwillkillyou      /projects/it-will-kill-you     301
/projects/miniMages          /projects/mini-mages           301
/projects/minimages          /projects/mini-mages           301
/projects/nightLight         /projects/night-light          301
/projects/nightlight         /projects/night-light          301
/projects/secretGarden       /projects/secret-garden        301
/projects/secretgarden       /projects/secret-garden        301
/projects/tiltingAtWindmills /projects/tilting-at-windmills 301
